        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>修井方案要针对具体故障（井下落物、套管变形、出水水淹、砂卡出砂、管柱断脱）选定<b>工艺</b>与<b>工具组合</b>，它决定作业周期与一次成功率。现在的编制过程是：翻这口井的井史与历次作业总结 → 找同区块类似故障的井 → 凭经验判断哪些做法能用 → 手写方案报审。</p><p>问题有三个：<b>慢</b>——一口井的方案编制要 2—3 天；<b>不一致</b>——同类故障在不同井上的处理方式差异很大，年轻工程师上手慢；<b>经验流失</b>——老师傅的判断依据从不落纸，人一退休，一千多井次的作业经验就等于不存在。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 660 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='人工编制与图谱检索的对比'><rect x='12' y='26' width='266' height='150' rx='9' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#d3c9b6'/><text x='28' y='46' font-size='10' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' letter-spacing='1.4'>MANUAL · 人工编制</text><rect x='28' y='60' width='64' height='80' rx='4' fill='#efe9dd' stroke='#d3c9b6'/><rect x='100' y='68' width='64' height='72' rx='4' fill='#efe9dd' stroke='#d3c9b6'/><rect x='172' y='56' width='64' height='84' rx='4' fill='#efe9dd' stroke='#d3c9b6'/><text x='60' y='103' font-size='9.5' fill='#6f7a7c' text-anchor='middle'>井史</text><text x='132' y='108' font-size='9.5' fill='#6f7a7c' text-anchor='middle'>作业总结</text><text x='204' y='102' font-size='9.5' fill='#6f7a7c' text-anchor='middle'>工具手册</text><text x='28' y='158' font-size='10' fill='#a64b3c'>逐份翻阅 · 依赖班组记忆 · 同类故障做法不一</text><path d='M292 100 L342 100' stroke='#d3c9b6' stroke-width='1.4'/><path d='M336 95 L344 100 L336 105 Z' fill='#d3c9b6'/><text x='316' y='88' font-size='10' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='middle'>2—3 天</text><rect x='350' y='26' width='298' height='150' rx='9' fill='#faf7f0' stroke='#c8d9d1'/><text x='366' y='46' font-size='10' font-family='monospace' fill='#1d4e50' letter-spacing='1.4'>GRAPH · 图谱检索</text><circle cx='404' cy='104' r='15' fill='#e7eee9' stroke='#1d4e50'/><circle cx='474' cy='74' r='13' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#a9742c'/><circle cx='474' cy='134' r='13' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#a9742c'/><circle cx='548' cy='74' r='15' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#355c74'/><circle cx='548' cy='134' r='15' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#355c74'/><circle cx='612' cy='104' r='13' fill='#e7eee9' stroke='#1d4e50'/><path d='M418 97 L462 78 M418 111 L462 130 M486 70 L534 74 M486 138 L534 134 M562 70 L600 98 M562 138 L600 112' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.2' fill='none'/><path d='M418 100 L462 126 M486 136 L534 136 M562 138 L602 110' stroke='#1d4e50' stroke-width='2' fill='none' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><text x='404' y='145' font-size='8.5' fill='#4a585c' text-anchor='middle'>井况</text><text x='474' y='54' font-size='8.5' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='middle'>工艺</text><text x='548' y='54' font-size='8.5' fill='#355c74' text-anchor='middle'>工具</text><text x='612' y='86' font-size='8.5' fill='#123a3d' text-anchor='middle'>效果</text><text x='366' y='168' font-size='10' fill='#123a3d'>相似度排序 · 每条推荐都附历史证据（虚线为命中路径）</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>图 1</b><span>同样一件事：左边是把经验装在人脑里，右边是把经验装进图里。区别不在快慢，而在<b>可追溯</b>——推荐结果能指着一条历史作业说「因为这三口井是这么做的、成功率多少」。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>这里用的不是「训一个模型直接输出方案」，而是<b>知识图谱 + 案例推理（CBR）</b>：先做<b>实体与关系抽取</b>，把非结构化的作业总结变成结构化的四元组——<b>故障现象 → 选用工艺 → 使用工具 → 作业效果</b>；再把这套关系连同井况数值（井深、套管通径、含水率、是否出砂；落物/断脱类再加落物形态与外径）一起，建成案例库。</p><p>推荐时把当前井况编码成一个特征向量，在案例库里做<b>加权相似度检索</b>（分类特征按相等给分，数值特征按区间隶属度给分），输出同族 Top-3 相似作业，再按「相似度 × 历史成功率」排序成候选方案。算法输出的是<b>候选 + 证据</b>，最终签字的仍然是工程师。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 660 216' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='故障—工艺—工具—效果四类实体与关系'><defs><marker id='ar1' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='6' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0 L6 3 L0 6 Z' fill='#c3cdc4'/></marker></defs><rect x='10' y='20' width='146' height='176' rx='9' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e3dccd'/><text x='26' y='40' font-size='9.5' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' letter-spacing='1.2'>① 故障现象</text><rect x='26' y='52' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f5e6e1' stroke='#dcc3bd'/><text x='83' y='67' font-size='10' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='middle'>井下落物</text><rect x='26' y='80' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f5e6e1' stroke='#dcc3bd'/><text x='83' y='95' font-size='10' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='middle'>套管变形</text><rect x='26' y='108' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f5e6e1' stroke='#dcc3bd'/><text x='83' y='123' font-size='10' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='middle'>出水水淹</text><rect x='26' y='136' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f5e6e1' stroke='#dcc3bd'/><text x='83' y='151' font-size='10' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='middle'>砂卡出砂</text><rect x='26' y='164' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f5e6e1' stroke='#dcc3bd'/><text x='83' y='179' font-size='10' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='middle'>管柱断脱</text><rect x='176' y='20' width='146' height='176' rx='9' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e3dccd'/><text x='192' y='40' font-size='9.5' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' letter-spacing='1.2'>② 工艺</text><rect x='192' y='52' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#e3d2b0'/><text x='249' y='67' font-size='10' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='middle'>打捞 / 磨铣</text><rect x='192' y='80' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#e3d2b0'/><text x='249' y='95' font-size='10' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='middle'>套管整形</text><rect x='192' y='108' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#e3d2b0'/><text x='249' y='123' font-size='10' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='middle'>找堵水</text><rect x='192' y='136' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#e3d2b0'/><text x='249' y='151' font-size='10' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='middle'>冲砂 / 防砂</text><rect x='192' y='164' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#e3d2b0'/><text x='249' y='179' font-size='10' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='middle'>压井（前置）</text><rect x='342' y='20' width='146' height='176' rx='9' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e3dccd'/><text x='358' y='40' font-size='9.5' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' letter-spacing='1.2'>③ 工具</text><rect x='358' y='52' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='415' y='67' font-size='10' fill='#355c74' text-anchor='middle'>卡瓦打捞筒</text><rect x='358' y='80' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='415' y='95' font-size='10' fill='#355c74' text-anchor='middle'>捞矛 / 震击器</text><rect x='358' y='108' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='415' y='123' font-size='10' fill='#355c74' text-anchor='middle'>磨鞋 / 套铣筒</text><rect x='358' y='136' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='415' y='151' font-size='10' fill='#355c74' text-anchor='middle'>滚压整形器</text><rect x='358' y='164' width='114' height='22' rx='5' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='415' y='179' font-size='10' fill='#355c74' text-anchor='middle'>桥塞 / 化学堵剂</text><rect x='508' y='20' width='142' height='176' rx='9' fill='#faf7f0' stroke='#c8d9d1'/><text x='524' y='40' font-size='9.5' font-family='monospace' fill='#5f7d72' letter-spacing='1.2'>④ 效果</text><rect x='524' y='56' width='110' height='30' rx='5' fill='#e7eee9' stroke='#c8dbd2'/><text x='579' y='75' font-size='10' fill='#123a3d' text-anchor='middle'>一次成功</text><rect x='524' y='94' width='110' height='30' rx='5' fill='#e7eee9' stroke='#c8dbd2'/><text x='579' y='113' font-size='10' fill='#123a3d' text-anchor='middle'>多次起下钻</text><rect x='524' y='132' width='110' height='30' rx='5' fill='#e7eee9' stroke='#c8dbd2'/><text x='579' y='151' font-size='10' fill='#123a3d' text-anchor='middle'>需二次措施</text><path d='M148 63 L184 63' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ar1)'/><path d='M148 147 L184 147' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ar1)'/><path d='M314 63 L350 63' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ar1)'/><path d='M314 147 L350 147' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ar1)'/><path d='M480 63 L516 71' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ar1)'/><text x='166' y='192' font-size='9' fill='#99a3a4' text-anchor='middle'>触发</text><text x='332' y='192' font-size='9' fill='#99a3a4' text-anchor='middle'>选用</text><text x='498' y='192' font-size='9' fill='#99a3a4' text-anchor='middle'>评价</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>图 2</b><span>知识图谱的骨架就这么四列。难点不在图大小，而在<b>从作业总结里抽出这些边</b>——「用卡瓦打捞筒捞出了油管」这句话要变成 井下落物 →(触发) 打捞 →(选用) 卡瓦打捞筒 →(评价) 一次成功 这条链。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p>这套方法的门槛不高但很「脏」：核心不是算法，而是把历史作业记录整理成可计算的形式。下面五项缺一项，推荐质量都会明显下降。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 5</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>井史与故障描述</span><span class='cl-s'>井身结构、生产历史、故障现象、发生时间</span></span><span class='cl-n'>500—2000 井次</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>修井设计与总结</span><span class='cl-s'>工艺、工具组合、作业结果，非结构化文本</span></span><span class='cl-n'>抽 200 份人工校核</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>作业时效记录</span><span class='cl-s'>各工序起止时间、总工期</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于工期区间估计</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>工具台账与规格</span><span class='cl-s'>型号、适用套管内径、最小可通过尺寸</span></span><span class='cl-n'>规则库，非学习数据</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='4'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>标准术语表</span><span class='cl-s'>工具名、工序名的同义词与规范写法</span></span><span class='cl-n'>图谱能用的前提</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:4px'><span class='dtag' data-d='高'>难度 高</span><span class='small muted'>难在文本抽取质量与评价口径，不在模型选型</span></div><div class='meter'><i class='on'></i><i class='on'></i><i class='on hi'></i></div><p>一段「起原井管柱，下磨鞋磨铣 3 h，下篮式捞筒捞出落物，试压合格」要抽出 3 个动作、2 个工具、1 个结果，还要对齐到标准术语表——这一步的准确率直接决定图谱可用性。样本量也偏小：单区块 1000—2000 井次，分摊到 5 类故障上每类只有几百条，靠数据堆不出精度，必须把规则、术语表和检索做得扎实。</p><p>建议的推进顺序：① 先做<b>规则 + 术语表</b>抽取结构化字段（工具、工序），不求全、求准；② 人工校核 100—200 井次作为评测集，量化抽取准确率；③ 再上文本分类 / 序列标注模型处理描述性段落；④ 最后做相似度检索与排序，并把工程师的采纳 / 否决结果回写，让排序权重随使用自我修正。</p><p style='margin-top:18px'><span class='kicker plain' style='color:var(--ink-4)'>可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class='refs'><span class='ref'>知识图谱构建</span><span class='ref'>案例推理 CBR</span><span class='ref'>文本信息抽取</span><span class='ref'>相似度检索与排序</span></div><div class='callout warn'><span class='ci'>注意</span><span>推荐系统在这一环的定位是<b>方案初稿生成器</b>：它的价值是把候选与证据摆到工程师面前，把「想」的时间省掉，而不是替人签字。凡是涉及井控安全的工序（压井、井筒完整性处理），候选排序里必须带上风险提示。</span></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
